OL,3,GNEWSAExhibition opens to celebrate
OL,4,Agarden's history
OL,5,
OL,6,FAn exhibition into the Victorian
OL,7,Fhistory of a Royal Horticultural
OL,8,FSociety (RHS) owned garden has opened
OL,9,Fto the public.
OL,11,FBefore its purchase in 1903, RHS
OL,12,FWisley, in Surrey, it existed as a
OL,13,Fmuddy landscape.
OL,15,FIt became the project of George
OL,16,FFergusson Wilson, who used his passion
OL,17,Ffor science, plants and innovation and
OL,18,Flaid the foundations for what it is
OL,19,Fnow.
